@startuml ticketing-architecture
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title Ticketing — 개요 (Choreography Saga)

actor Client

component "Gateway\n:8089" as GW
component "Reservation\n:8081" as R
component "Ticket\n:8080" as T
component "Payment\n:8082" as P

queue "Kafka" as K
database "Redis\n캐시 · 락" as Redis
database "DB\n(H2·서비스별)" as DB

Client --> GW : HTTP
GW --> R
GW --> T

R --> K
T --> K
P --> K
K --> R : 이벤트 소비
K --> T
K --> P

R --> Redis
T --> Redis
R --> DB
T --> DB
P --> DB

note bottom of K
  **성공:** 예약요청 → 좌석·결제 → 확정 이벤트
  **실패:** 결제실패 → 예약취소 → 좌석해제 (보상)
  **DLT:** 재시도 소진 시 .DLT → 멱등 재처리
end note

@enduml
